<title>ITALY: GOLF-LEADING PRIZE MONEY WINNERS ON EUROPEAN TOUR.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING PRIZE MONEY WINNERS ON EUROPEAN TOUR.</headline>
<dateline>BRESCIA, Italy 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
